ccusage adaptations

Upstream: https://github.com/ccusage/ccusage
Revision: 615bd802bc5c50246b84e98406f20ab048e27cf6

Adapted into swiftbar_claude_usage.py (response identity, sidechain replay,
advisor usage, stored cost and cache duration), swiftbar_claude.py (discovery),
and swiftbar_sources.py (Codex token deltas and compressed rollout selection).
The plugin retains its Python/SQLite incremental index and Claude App ownership
filter. Upstream adapters and ccusage-core are the reference; ccusage is not a
runtime dependency.

